    EMGorg -.->|владеет| ABAI
    KC -.-> SAPP
    KMGI -.-> ISUP

    ISUN -->|OPC DA| IMnode
    ASUTP -->|OPC UA| IMnode
    AGZU -->|SQL+OPC UA| IMnode
    SDMO -->|MySQL| IMnode
    KUUN -->|Modbus| IMnode
    KTM -->|SQL| IMnode
    ABAI -->|SQL read| IMnode
    ASDC -.->|диспетчеризация| IMnode

    UTOEMG -->|локальный контур| UTO
    ABAI -->|REST/SMTP| ISOT
    ABAI -.->|REST JSON| SAPFIR
    ABAI -.-> BDA
    IMnode -->|REST JSON :8099| BDA

    UTO <-->|SOAP XML| SAPP
    Argus -->|REST JSON| UTO
    SAPP <-->|SAP PO/XML| ASUNSI
    SAS -->|RFC/CSV| SAPP
    SAPP --> FC & ZUP & SIZ & Platts
    SAPP <-->|MT940/103| BV
    SAPP <-->|XML| ISEF & NB
    AVR <-->|API XML| SAPP
    EA <-->|API| SAPP
    UP <-->|SOAP/CMIS| SAPP & EA
    Procu <-->|API JSON| ASUNSI & ISEZ
    SP & SAPFIR -->|API/REST JSON| KHD

    SAPFIR & ISOT & SDD & Procu & Team & Intranet & Compliance & KGIS & Alfresco --> AD
    DLP & FUDO & EPASS & Zhyldyz --> AD
    Exchange & FW -.-> DLP

    classDef emgNet fill:#e8f5e9,stroke:#2e7d32,stroke-width:2px
    classDef kmgNet fill:#e3f2fd,stroke:#1565c0,stroke-width:2px
    classDef ot fill:#fff3e0,stroke:#e65100
    class NetEMG,CoreEMG,IM emgNet
    class NetKMG,CorpIS,SAPBlock kmgNet
    class ISUN,ASUTP,AGZU,KUUN,SDMO,KTM ot
